   "text": "WHAT MAKES IT HARD TO CHANGE\n\n1. One class does everything: HTTP, cache, HTML parsing, DB, rules, scoring, files, report.\n2. The site is hardcoded. Kleinanzeigen URLs + HTML regex sit in the class. 'site' in the profile is not used.\n3. Bike logic is in the code: two_brakes, accessories, size range 40–80. New item type = code change.\n4. Kill rules run twice (prefilter + score), in two different code paths.\n5. State is one text field: verdict = NULL | '' | kill_* | scored.\n6. Outputs are global: scored.json, report.md, finalists/ get overwritten by the next profile.\n7. Fragile: a profile without e.g. title_exclude → KeyError. Price '1.200 €' parses as 1.\n8. No tests. When the site HTML changes, parsers fail silently (0 ads, empty fields).",
   "originalText": "WHAT MAKES IT HARD TO CHANGE\n\n1. One class does everything: HTTP, cache, HTML parsing, DB, rules, scoring, files, report.\n2. The site is hardcoded. Kleinanzeigen URLs + HTML regex sit in the class. 'site' in the profile is not used.\n3. Bike logic is in the code: two_brakes, accessories, size range 40–80. New item type = code change.\n4. Kill rules run twice (prefilter + score), in two different code paths.\n5. State is one text field: verdict = NULL | '' | kill_* | scored.\n6. Outputs are global: scored.json, report.md, finalists/ get overwritten by the next profile.\n7. Fragile: a profile without e.g. title_exclude → KeyError. Price '1.200 €' parses as 1.\n8. No tests. When the site HTML changes, parsers fail silently (0 ads, empty fields).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "prob",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
